arries your bags and suitcases).<br>  <br>These are suggestions for how much you can tip:<br>  <br>For housekeeping: about 3 dollars a night. Leave the money on the table near the phone at the end of your stay.<br>  <br>For the bellboy: about 1-2 dollars per bag.<br>  <br>In some countries, you do not tip. It is not polite. Be sure to read about the customs in the country you want to visit.<br>", "type": "describer"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "single room", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a room for one person at a hotel ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like a single room, please.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use at a hotel.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "double room", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a room for two people at a hotel", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to stay in a double room please.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "continental breakfast ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a light breakfast in a hotel that usually includes baked goods, jam, fruit, and coffee", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would like the continental breakfast.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "balcony ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a platform outside a room at a hotel or apartment building", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: All of our rooms have balconies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn3le04ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "cont